credscope (0.2.2-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging, prepared for a Kali Linux New Tool Request.
  * Builds credscope from Go source with the system Go toolchain; the code
    is not downloaded or repackaged from a prebuilt GitHub Release binary.
  * Switched CredScope's own Go import from go.yaml.in/yaml/v3 (not
    packaged in Debian/Kali) to the already-packaged gopkg.in/yaml.v3.
    Every real build dependency (cobra, pflag, mousetrap, yaml.v3) is now
    available in the Debian/Kali archive, so this package builds with
    dh-golang against system Go libraries. There is no vendor/ directory.
    See debian/README.source for the full explanation.
  * Not yet submitted to Kali or Debian.

